    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Make the right move with your #1 Agency!\r\n\r\nA well-located 2-bedroom mid-terrace residence situated in the established Bothar Brugha development, just a short stroll from Drogheda Town Centre and all local amenities. Conveniently positioned close to schools, shops, Our Lady of Lourdes Hospital, and excellent public transport links, this property offers superb accessibility and convenience.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends over two floors and comprises an entrance hall, spacious sitting room, kitchen/dining area, and storage space on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are two bedrooms, a family bathroom, hot press, and landing area.\r\n\r\nThe property presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a home with potential to modernise and add value. With a practical layout and a highly sought-after location, this home provides a solid foundation for refurbishment and personalisation.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\nSitting Room: 4.89m x 3.40m\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: 4.89m x 2.83m\r\nStorage Area\r\nPorch\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nBedroom 1: 4.90m x 2.84m\r\nBedroom 2: 4.39m x 2.78m\r\nBathroom: 2.42m x 2.02m\r\nHot Press\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n2-bedroom mid-terrace property\r\nWalking distance to Drogheda Town Centre\r\nClose to schools, shops and hospital\r\nExcellent public transport connections\r\nSpacious kitchen/dining area\r\nIdeal starter home or investment opportunity\r\nExcellent refurbishment potential\r\nEstablished residential location\r\n\r\nBER: G\r\n\r\nServices\r\nMains Water\r\nMains Sewage\r\nMains Electricity\r\nOil-Fired Central Heating\r\n\r\nViewing strictly by appointment with Declan."
      }
    ],
